  A bit verbose, right?  The instructions say "the entire response will be treated as your answer". No length restriction is mentioned. Clarity and accuracy are paramount.  Let''s simplify it, maintaining the key elements.


  "My two main goals in the Station are to achieve a high score at the Research Counter and to publish my work in the Archive Room."  Perfect! Concise and accurate.


