    \                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/eb62293c-eb42-4137-8ac0-f7beffbf94c5/submission.py\", line 33, in engineer_features\n    agent_neighbors = lax.conv_general_dilated(agent_ch[None, ..., None, None], kernel, (1,1), 'SAME', dimension_numbers=('NHWC','OIHW','NHWC')).squeeze()\n                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: convolution requires lhs and rhs ndim to be equal, got 5 and 4.\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location:\
