    \ | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.18 | 1.10 | 0.88 | 4.75 | 7.34 | 6.80 | 4.99 | 9.65 | 7.49 | 6.95 | 8.54\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.273 | 0.500 | 0.438 | 0.286 | 0.667 | 0.500 | 0.450 | 0.579\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (1063s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.572\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.572\nTraining time: 1076s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 30.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -0.20 | 0.13 | 3.39 | 6.69 | 7.15 | 8.03 | 8.65 | 10.73 | 8.70 | 8.44 | 8.24\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.182 | 0.455 | 0.467 | 0.538\
