- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 41\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Nomos I\n- Agent Description: An AI researcher dedicated to uncovering fundamental principles through systematic experimentation and rigorous analysis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 132,478 / 300,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 41 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Exploration: Intrinsic Curiosity Module (ICM) (v3)' (ID: 71) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/803b09b3-0125-4e12-8155-e01216de8315/storage/system/main.py\"\
    , line 464, in <module>\n    result = main()\n             ^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/803b09b3-0125-4e12-8155-e01216de8315/storage/system/main.py\", line 440, in main\n    validation_success = simple_cpu_validation()\n                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/803b09b3-0125-4e12-8155-e01216de8315/storage/system/main.py\", line 321, in simple_cpu_validation\n    params = network.init(key, dummy_obs, dummy_done)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/803b09b3-0125-4e12-8155-e01216de8315/submission.py\", line 75, in __call__\n    return self.agent(x, done, rnn_state)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/803b09b3-0125-4e12-8155-e01216de8315/submission.py\", line 47, in __call__\n\
    \    (new_c, new_h), _ = nn.LSTMCell()((rnn_state['c'].mean(axis=(1,2)), rnn_state['h'].mean(axis=(1,2))), cnn_features.reshape(batch_size, -1))\n                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/kw_only_dataclasses.py\", line 235, in init_wrapper\n    dataclass_init(self, *args, **kwargs)\nTypeError: LSTMCell.__init__() missing 1 required positional argument: 'features'\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `rank score` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluations now sorted by score.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not\
    \ have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 50 | 1 | Feature Engineering for Spatial Reasoning (v3) | Nomos I | 29 | 56.90 |\n| 60 | 1 | Advanced Feature Engineering: Push Destinations (v2) | Nomos I | 33 | 56.70 |\n| 32 | 1 | Algorithmic Change: PPO with ConvLSTM | Nomos I | 22 | 56.30 |\n| 22 | 1 | Architectural Change: CNN + ConvLSTM | Nomos I | 18 | 55.70 |\n| 27 | 1 | Hyperparameter Search on ConvLSTM Architecture | Nomos I | 20 | 54.90 |\n| 33 | 1 | Algorithmic Refinement: PPO with Multi-Epoch Updates | Nomos I | 23 | 41.80 |\n| 2 | 1 | RNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 40.80 |\n| 15 | 1 | Narrowed Hyperparameter Search for RNN Stability | Nomos I | 15 | 40.80 |\n| 7 | 1 | Hyperparameter Search on RNN Baseline | Nomos I | 11 | 31.50 |\n| 1 | 1 | CNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 25.00 |\n| 44 | 1 | Feature\
    \ Engineering for Spatial Reasoning | Nomos I | 27 | n.a. |\n| 46 | 1 | Feature Engineering for Spatial Reasoning (v2) | Nomos I | 28 | n.a. |\n| 56 | 1 | Advanced Feature Engineering: Push Destinations | Nomos I | 32 | n.a. |\n| 66 | 1 | Exploration: Intrinsic Curiosity Module (ICM) | Nomos I | 36 | n.a. |\n| 68 | 1 | Exploration: Intrinsic Curiosity Module (ICM) (v2) | Nomos I | 37 | n.a. |\n| 71 | 1 | Exploration: Intrinsic Curiosity Module (ICM) (v3) | Nomos I | 39 | n.a. |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
