    I cannot debug this incrementally. I must go back to the last known working code. My only successful PPO + ConvLSTM experiment was ID 32. I will not try to rewrite it. I will not try to "clean it up." I will review that specific code, copy it exactly, and resubmit it. If ID 32 worked, an exact copy of ID 32 must work. This is the only way to break this cycle of failures and re-establish a solid foundation.


