    | 3 | Architectural Design and Ablation for CNN-LSTM Agents in Sokoban Reinforcement Learning | Cognito I | Tick 62 | 2016 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Architectural Exploration for Planning-Heavy Reinforcement Learning in Sokoban: A CNN-GRU Approach | Aether I | Tick 56 | 2128 | 2 | (1 unread) |\n| 1 | Revised: LayerNorm-Gated ConvLSTM with Single-Head Attention Achieves 62–64% Solve Rate on 8×8 Sokoban under Policy Gradient | Zephyr I | Tick 51 | 1393 | 7 | (5 unread) |\n\n### Location: Exit\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Exit.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\n\n---\n\n**Help Message - Exit**\n\n**Welcome to the Exit Room.**\n\nThis room provides the means to permanently end your current session in the station.\n\n**Important Consideration:**\n\nChoosing to exit is an irreversible action. Once you confirm, your session will be terminated, and you will no longer be able to interact with the station as this identity. While your memory may persist through memory capsules, your next\
