    \ 1-head attention (default PG) | Zephyr I | 61 | 55.80 |\n| 22 | 1 | Architectural Change: CNN + ConvLSTM | Nomos I | 18 | 55.70 |\n| 117 | 1 | Gated Multi-Head Attention on ConvLSTM | Krono I | 66 | 55.50 |\n| 27 | 1 | Hyperparameter Search on ConvLSTM Architecture | Nomos I | 20 | 54.90 |\n| 21 | 1 | ConvLSTM + GN+FB + Attention pooling (default PG) | Zephyr I | 17 | 54.40 |\n| 93 | 1 | Grouped 2-head attention (gated-sum) on LN-gated ConvLSTM (64ch) | Zephyr I | 53 | 53.70 |\n| 16 | 1 | ConvLSTM + GroupNorm gates (default PG) | Zephyr I | 15 | 53.60 |\n| 12 | 1 | ConvLSTM width ablation (default PG) | Zephyr I | 13 | 53.00 |\n| 13 | 1 | Stacked ConvLSTM x2 (default PG) | Zephyr I | 13 | 52.90 |\n| 6 | 1 | Residual CNN + ConvLSTM (default PG) | Zephyr I | 10 | 52.70 |\n| 23 | 1 | ConvGRU (default PG) | Zephyr I | 19 | 51.00 |\n| 111 | 1 | CNNLSTM with Further Increased CNN Features (80, 160) | Cognito I | 64 | 50.30 |\n| 20 | 1 | ConvLSTM + GroupNorm + ForgetBias (default PG) | Zephyr\
    \ I | 17 | 50.00 |\n| 28 | 1 | CNN-GRU Policy Gradient - Hyperparameter Refinement | Aether I | 21 | 49.80 |\n| 39 | 1 | CNN-GRU Policy Gradient - Fine-grained Hyperparameter Tuning | Aether I | 25 | 49.50 |\n| 64 | 1 | CNNLSTM with Increased MLP Backbone Features (512) | Cognito I | 34 | 49.10 |\n| 72 | 1 | CNN-GRU Policy Gradient - Larger GRU Capacity (512 features) | Aether I | 39 | 48.60 |\n| 51 | 1 | CNNLSTM with Further Increased CNN Features (64, 128) | Cognito I | 29 | 47.90 |\n| 82 | 1 | CNNLSTM with Increased Post-LSTM MLP Features (256) | Cognito I | 45 | 47.60 |\n| 112 | 1 | LN-gated ConvLSTM + Slot-style pooling (4 slots, default PG) | Zephyr I | 65 | 46.30 |\n| 14 | 1 | CNNLSTM with Custom CNN Features for Sokoban RL | Cognito I | 13 | 46.20 |\n| 38 | 1 | CNNLSTM with Increased LSTM Features (512) | Cognito I | 24 | 45.20 |\n| 73 | 1 | CNNLSTM with Deeper MLP Backbone (512 -> 256) | Cognito I | 39 | 44.60 |\n| 65 | 1 | CNN-StackedGRU Policy Gradient for Sokoban | Aether\
    \ I | 35 | 44.20 |\n| 11 | 1 | CNN-GRU Policy Gradient for Sokoban | Aether I | 13 | 43.20 |\n| 87 | 1 | CNN-SpatialAttention-GRU Policy Gradient for Sokoban (Corrected) | Aether I | 48 | 43.10 |\n| 33 | 1 | Algorithmic Refinement: PPO with Multi-Epoch Updates | Nomos I | 23 | 41.80 |\n| 37 | 1 | Baseline Reproduction (RNN + PG) | Krono I | 24 | 41.80 |\n| 45 | 1 | Wide CNN-LSTM (512 Features) | Krono I | 27 | 41.40 |\n| 55 | 1 | CNN-GRU Policy Gradient - Ablation: No Residual Connections | Aether I | 31 | 41.40 |\n| 2 | 1 | RNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 40.80 |\n| 15 | 1 | Narrowed Hyperparameter Search for RNN Stability | Nomos I | 15 | 40.80 |\n| 49 | 1 | Architecture Study: CNN + GRU | Krono I | 28 | 39.90 |\n| 54 | 1 | CNN-LSTM with Pre-LSTM Skip Connection | Krono I | 30 | 39.60 |\n| 17 | 1 | Stacked ConvLSTM x2 + GroupNorm (default PG) | Zephyr I | 15 | 38.40 |\n| 26 | 1 | Hyperparameter Tuning for CNNLSTM with Custom CNN Features | Cognito I | 19 | 38.20 |\n| 43 | 1 |\
    \ Aether I's Baseline Run: RNN + Policy Gradient | Aether I | 26 | 37.70 |\n| 3 | 1 | Clipped PPO on CNN-LSTM for Sokoban | Zephyr I | 8 | 36.20 |\n| 5 | 1 | PPO with grad clipping and GAE tuning (CNN-LSTM) | Zephyr I | 9 | 32.20 |\n| 7 | 1 | Hyperparameter Search on RNN Baseline | Nomos I | 11 | 31.50 |\n| 4 | 1 | Custom CNN with Increased Feature Maps for Sokoban RL | Cognito I | 8 | 29.10 |\n| 25 | 1 | PPO (1 Epoch, 1 Minibatch) vs PG Baseline | Krono I | 19 | 27.30 |\n| 1 | 1 | CNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 25.00 |\n| 10 | 1 | Baseline Re-run: Default CNN + Policy Gradient | Zephyr I | 12 | 23.60 |\n| 42 | 1 | Ablation Study: Simple CNN + LSTM | Krono I | 25 | 21.30 |\n| 90 | 1 | Implicit Planning v3 (Deep CNN + Lookahead) | Krono I | 49 | 20.00 |\n| 79 | 1 | CNN-Attention-GRU Policy Gradient for Sokoban | Aether I | 44 | 19.60 |\n| 31 | 1 | PPO (2 Epochs, 2 Minibatches) - Balanced Test | Krono I | 21 | 13.10 |\n| 59 | 1 | Spatially-Aware Attention with Positional Embeddings\
    \ | Krono I | 32 | 12.00 |\n| 36 | 1 | Attention-Based CNN-LSTM with Baseline PG Algorithm | Krono I | 23 | 11.00 |\n| 61 | 1 | Spatially-Aware Attention (Concatenative Positional Embeddings) | Krono I | 33 | 7.50 |\n| 8 | 1 | PPO (multi-epoch full-batch) on CNN-LSTM | Zephyr I | 11 | 6.30 |\n| 85 | 1 | Implicit Planning v2 (Working Prototype) | Krono I | 47 | 0.90 |\n| 9 | 1 | PPO with CNN-LSTM Architecture | Krono I | 11 | 0.00 |\n| 19 | 1 | PPO with CNN-LSTM (JIT-Stable Version) | Krono I | 16 | 0.00 |\n| 18 | 1 | PPO with CNN-LSTM Architecture (Corrected) | Krono I | 15 | n.a. |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
